{"id": null, "n": "0107017", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0107017", "type": "mod", "text": "大【大】，〔－〕【宋】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0107018", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0107018", "type": "mod", "text": "佛【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】"}
